    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b21882b5dea065304bb460c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄传说",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2e4953a8adb23b00064ed92298a98ec0875d81773561eb95f148a63b8bd7a22",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:852a6eefe17fc160b82aca6f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是打算先安排一场前哨战，\n参加场地、距离皆与德比相同的“青叶赏”──",
      "source_fingerprint": "56254af3edea900fcdde9608f2a3c687d37bc4775c9e900174944bc3fdd11ea4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:231d3b08f8ebe5735ca160ef",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄传说",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2e4953a8adb23b00064ed92298a98ec0875d81773561eb95f148a63b8bd7a22",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:035dd869109631ff97a56f46",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而至今史上尚未有赛马娘能够接连赢得\n“青叶赏”与“日本德比”。不过也正因如此，\n一旦达成便能获得最耀眼的英雄勋章。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8317e7dd29476805e3f3c4007521770f7de14a8fa093365fb247782ca2becb8f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8318f7e41ccee46250f9055",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄传说",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2e4953a8adb23b00064ed92298a98ec0875d81773561eb95f148a63b8bd7a22",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047419.json",
