    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd8c79d91e66bdc518ce654a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "拍板定案下一个目标是“青叶赏”。\n确定王道通往何方后，故事又翻过了新的一页。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1cb112f854ee6f9929ef947c3437f05310ec98a51fd66a0c0f15bd17c1222fa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3feecb6d2cabde8f7d936939",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目标达成后・那天我看到的故事",
      "source_fingerprint": "883fc48e78aa71a8ae18d25e5f8ddb20b9ad3d2ee681c468701fa9bb72ef36be",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047419.json",
