    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6578200f53a39201ff17a758",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄称霸了“日本德比”。\n在吉兆的见证之下，\n她当上了从往日便心生向往的故事中的主角。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf055cbedd13b607b766c35dce3a3e1cb0bfcdd740db9a7da23cb89849d513c9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
