      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她接连赢得“青叶赏”与“日本德比”，\n竞赛史上至今还未有人能达成此创举。\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "0078382053f25ab64ec1f48dcb8d75803d9e76c0602fd220d543acc0286b1d87",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
