      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "下一场目标竞赛是“菊花赏”。\n也是个跟未来的英雄十分相称的大舞台。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49631b3347577f7e34dd942dcad2d8687ce2040091a6b741eb5a2d3edbafd7e4",
